94_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z7m13OeF_ckQ7kNvwEGz0Wv&_nc_oc=Adqvz0jPIb9tOBR8UuhUiMgsIMBsIfpKJ68Y5omFVI03hRz07q4oWGPdUsbDwxJiif0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRZxBd30Os81QCkKE8IcJQOHYOiGElmW5z6FzdIJtWQww&oe=6AFF28B8"}, {"file_name": "screen4.png", "id": "1658166027932438", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75241698_1658166031265771_1482428283944475893_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dCKO2FXu0l4Q7kNvwFsQKFs&_nc_oc=AdrFbuzxXm6YvbgdeWu5xDwhhuNIGFlSd6pnvsV8s5gGhWI6oDhUvPiMgCg7_0MLFZ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSQqHkRI8mxK8df3k3jnkevMVCMXNpP9t422MeMlN44oA&oe=6AFF2A71"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Graphics Showcase", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This application is a technical demo intended for Quest developers using Unreal Engine 5. \n\nTone mapping is an important artistic tool for developers. Graphics Showcase features a Vulkan subpass-based tone mapping solution that is much more performant than traditional techniques.\n\nPress B to cycle through these effects:\n- Day / Night cycle\n- Sepia LUT\n- Reddish LUT\n\nPress A to toggle tonemap subpass off / on\n\nPress Right Trigger to toggle FFR off / high\n\nPress Right Grip to toggle MSAA 1/2/4", "short_description": "This application is a technical demo intended for Quest developers using Unreal Engine 5. \n\nTone mapping is an important artistic tool for developers. Graphics Showcase features a Vulkan subpass-based tone mapping solution that is much more performant than traditional techniques. \n\nPress B to cycle through these effects:\n- Day / Night cycle\n- Sepia LUT\n- Reddish LUT\n\nPress A to toggle tonemap subpass off / on\n\nPress Right Trigger to toggle FFR off / high\n\nPress Right Grip to toggle MSAA 1/2/4"}]}, "developer_name": "Oculus Samples", "developer_privac